<title>JAPAN: Sanyo to build 10 bln yen LCD plant.</title>
<headline>Sanyo to build 10 bln yen LCD plant.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sanyo Electric Co said on Tuesday that it had decided to construct a liquid crystal display (LCD) plant in Japan at a cost of more than 10 billion yen.</p>
<p>More details would be announced on Wednesday from around 2.00 p.m. (0500 GMT), a Sanyo spokeswoman said.</p>
